Package: wellbeingEnrollment
Title: Workplace Wellbeing Program Enrollment Effect
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Anonymous", "Analyst", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Records from a voluntary workplace wellbeing program and helper
    functions for loading and validating the joined employee records. The
    analysis program that estimates the enrollment effect is written by the
    solver.
